OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for abusing teen he
OL,4,A'preyed on' over Snapchat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who sexually abused a teenage
OL,7,Fgirl he first contacted on Snapchat has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed for four years.
OL,10,FLiam Bunton, 35, of Ransom Avenue,
OL,11,FWorcester, was convicted of two counts
OL,12,Fof engaging in penetrative sexual
OL,13,Factivity with a teenage girl and
OL,14,Fsentenced at Worcester Crown Court on
OL,15,FFriday.
OL,17,FThe offences were not recent and took
OL,18,Fplace during the past decade, West
OL,19,FMercia Police said. However, they were
OL,20,Freported last year and Bunton was
OL,21,Fcharged in December.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
